title: Parlament votes on Healthcare Privatization
subtitle: The Catalan chamber, to make or break [? if health_minister_gender = "m": Conseller ?][? if health_minister_gender = "f": Consellera ?]of Health [+ health_minister +]'s proposal
view-if: healthcare_privatization_introduced
tags: event
